'' vendor/SDL3 DECLARES SDL_main.h's ROUTINES: a program written with SDL's main callbacks calls
'' SDL_EnterAppMainCallbacks with only the import, no declaration of its own (it was TKO0743,
'' "not declared", before SDL_main.ti). Compiled for linux-x86_64, where vendor/SDL3 links the
'' system's SDL3 and so needs no lib/ in the tree; no TKO0833 means the callbacks' types match.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_PKG=pkg
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.sdl3main/mc
'' ARGS: -target linux-x86_64 -c tests/modules/src/sdl3main/callbacks.tiko -o build/.sdl3main/callbacks.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.sdl3main/callbacks.o
